```css
/* one rule, grouped selectors, three declarations */
h1, h2 {
  color: #1a3c6e;
  margin: 0 0 1rem;          /* shorthand: top right/left bottom */
  font-weight: 700;
}

.card {
  display: grid;
  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;      /* shorthand */
  padding-left: 2rem;        /* longhand overrides one side */
}
```

| Part | Example |
|---|---|
| selector. | `h1, h2` — a comma groups selectors. |
| declaration. | `color: #1a3c6e;`. |
| shorthand. | `margin: 0 0 1rem` sets 4 longhands. |
| longhand after shorthand. | overrides just that side. |

